# T_SCRE: Install in on an item another session has deleted since the
# page came, as in SCRE54: the install is answered 200 naming the CHILD,
# not the parent typed, and the list is fetched again without the row.
# First Install in on item 1 into 99999, which names no item and is
# searched as text, finding none: left with Esc, the page stays as it
# is, stale row and all.
K ALT-C I
T 99999
K ENTER
S NOPARENT
K ESC ESC DOWN ALT-C I
T 1
K ENTER
S INTOGONE
K ESC
